  "notes": "Darkchild-lineage R&B/trap-pop producer, and the one model in this section where the 808 takes the low end outright. ⛔ `drums.bass808.role` is `bassline` and no `bassline` block is authored, which means the bass generator returns nothing and the sub *is* the bass. That is the entry's own claim, not a shortcut: \"heavy 808 sub with short slides, tuned to the vamp's root and 5th; the sub is the only low-mid content so the vocal stack has room.\" Giving this model a separate bass part would put content exactly where the research says there is none. The trap-pop core is the encoded mode — \"half-time (backbeat on 3) in the trap mode and 2&4 straight in the R&B mode\", core 130—145 — so `halfTime` is true at `halftime_3`. Because the placement matches the parent, the separation comes from the kit: \"half-time trap skeleton with 16th and 32nd hat rolls, finger snaps, and a deliberately narrow velocity range\", so `velocityTiers` is the narrowest table in this section (a 14-point accent band) and the roll vocabulary is 32nd-led at a high frequency over a `snap`-only perc list. His artist's stated praise — \"none of the beats he plays me ever sound the same … variety is achieved by changing the percussion palette, not the tempo\" — is why the tempo band is tight while the perc density range is wide. Keys are documented: \"D♭ major/minor and A♭ major recur across his flagship catalogue; C♯ minor on his best-known single.\" Harmony is \"2- or 4-bar minor-7th/9th vamps with no modulation, chosen so a stacked vocal can sit on top\", which is the low `triad` share, the vamp weighting and `maxChords` 3; \"a sparse instrumental palette — a single plucked or keyed motif plus the 808 — because the arrangement is designed around a dense multi-layer vocal stack\" is the low melody density and the high-density `octave_echo` counter. ⚠ `confidence` is medium against a medium-high rating because the research says the drum detail is \"partly lane-derived\": every drum probability, the velocity tiers, the humanize pair and `bpm.mode` 137 (the midpoint of the stated 130—145 trap-pop core) are INFERRED.",
